# NVIDIA kernel modules are NOT pre-installed.
# pg-gpu-sync detects the GPU during Calamares install and at boot, then
# installs the correct driver:
#   Turing+  (RTX 20xx+, GTX 16xx) → nvidia-open-dkms + nvidia-utils (590+)
#   Pascal/Maxwell/Volta (GTX 10xx, 900, 750) → equestria-nvidia-580xx-dkms + *-utils (v580)
#   Kepler   (GTX 600/700)         → nvidia-470xx-dkms + *-utils
#
# nvidia-utils (590+) is pre-installed for Turing+ majority.
# For Pascal/Maxwell, pg-gpu-sync replaces it with equestria-nvidia-580xx-utils.
nvidia-utils
egl-wayland
xorg-xwayland
qt6-wayland

